      "name": "KateWalker",
      "username": "TakeWalker",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/takewalker/{size}/5677_2.png",
      "created_at": "2017-07-11T23:22:37.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I just like knowing there was actually a person behind the rat. And I mean, he obviously wasn't a nice guy, he probably deserves what happened to him, but I always find myself sympathetic towards the rat, a la Setback. Ever since he was mutated, he's just been getting hungrier and angrier, and people keep experimenting on him and using him as a tool. :C He's just a big, gross puppy who can turn you into another big, gross puppy! Is that so bad? D:</p>",
