      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/saykhia/{size}/2132_2.png",
      "created_at": "2017-07-12T00:23:09.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>The episode started off with Christopher and Adam claiming they made up all this Sentinels Comics stuff including their history. And now those fond memories o<span>f reading tales of my favourite heroes are.. fading. And what about that time by happenstance I shook hands with that famous writer of Tome of the Bizzare (you know the one)? Now they're all made up? I hate it when real history gets retconned like that. What a conspiracy!</span></p>",
