      "created_at": "2017-07-12T09:14:59.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I <em>was</em> pretty amused by the tangle in trying to navigate the linguistic ambiguity of \"we just made that up\" in terms of non-canon joking and \"we just made that up\" in terms of how technically speaking they made <em>everything</em> in Sentinels Comics up, but some things they said were more made up than others...</p>",
