      "created_at": "2017-07-12T17:55:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>They can avoid mentioning other comic heroes in relation to their heroes but get too far on a tangent...</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Break me off a piece -&gt; Kit Kat ( wait can't say that) Bit Bat Bar -&gt; Bit Bat Car -&gt; Breaking peices off cars -&gt; Cars spliting into 2 motorcycles -&gt; Motorcycle spliting off car -&gt; Matban</p>",
